From: dotlouis <1891109+dotlouis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 23:28:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/41] MTROPOLIS: Support calculated fields and editing in
 text labels

Implement the Update Calculated Fields command, which replaces <name>
fields in a text label with the value of the variable of that name, and
the Enable/Disable Edit commands, which allow typing into a text label.
There is no caret or selection, the first keystroke replaces the text.

Also add the list variable "insert" attribute and accept writes to the
world manager "cursorelement" attribute, which is not implemented yet.

Used by Uncle Albert's Fabulous Voyage for its translated texts and
player name entry.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
